  "body": "Drive in to view this exceptional family home that is better than new, featuring premium window treatments, established gardens, and an electric louvred roof system, showcasing meticulous maintenance.\r\n\r\nPrivately positioned on a freehold 590sqm north-facing site, this substantial 263sqm G.J. Gardner residence offers an outstanding layout in an exclusive cul-de-sac on a highly sought-after street.\r\n\r\nBuilt in 2021 for effortless living and entertaining, expansive open-plan spaces flow seamlessly to a covered outdoor deck and flat wrap-around lawn. The electric louvred roof extends the living space year-round. The generous lawn provides ample room for play and potential for a future swimming pool.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a light-filled entertainer's kitchen with a large island, quality appliances, and a well-appointed scullery. A separate lounge, accessed via a feature barn door, offers a cosy retreat with a gas fireplace.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor includes a fifth bedroom or home office, powder room, and spacious laundry with outdoor access.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the fully air-conditioned master suite provides a private sanctuary with a walk-in wardrobe and underfloor-heated ensuite. Three additional double bedrooms with built-in wardrobes share a family bathroom and separate toilet.\r\n\r\nCompleting the package is a double internal-access garage, multiple off-street parks, and room for a boat or trailer.\r\n\r\nEnjoy being minutes from Mission Bay and Kohimarama beaches, with shopping and dining at Eastridge and Orakei Bay Village. Easy access to the CBD and transport further enhances the appeal.\r\n\r\nModern homes of this calibre in the coveted Eastern Bays are rarely available. Contact Richard Lyne on 021 687 000 or Pauline Brown on 021 731023 for viewing times or to arrange a private viewing.",
